### CastleDeepEvent::Config ###
	<StartTime>  One or more scheduled triggers, matched against the
	             real-world clock (-1 = any/wildcard for that field):
	             Year/Month/Day/DayOfWeek/Hour/Minute/Second.
	<Group>      Index/Rate - which of the (usually 2) monster-set
	             groups gets picked for the run, and its roll weight.
	<Spawn>      Index/Group/Minute - within group Index, the wave
	             numbered Group spawns Minute minutes after the event
	             starts.
	<Monster>    One row per monster entry in a wave:
	               Index    Which <Group> this belongs to.
	               Group    Which <Spawn> wave (within that group) this
	                        monster is part of.
	               Class    Monster class to spawn.
	               Count    How many of this monster spawn.
	               X/Y      Spawn area top-left corner.
	               TX/TY    Spawn area bottom-right corner.

STRICTLY NO COMMENTS INSIDE TAGS
-->

